  designNotes: Destroy target enemy creature; your weakest creature is sacrificed
    to play it. Black magic always takes something. With a Phoenix Feather the same
    Day, the feathered creature pays (one offering, every rite), and still rises.
  artDescription: A heavy book bound in stitched leather with a screaming face on
